==English==
===Etymology===
From Latin prefix '''[[con-]]''', ''with'', + '''[[strictus]]''', perfect passive participle of '''[[strigare]]'''.

===Pronunciation===
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɪkt|-ɪkt]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb|constricts|constricting|constricted|constricted}}

#to [[narrow]], especially by applying [[pressure]]

